Routing and exception handling,DRB-4,10014,Epic,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,07/Oct/26 9:57 AM,07/Oct/26 9:57 AM,,,,0,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},,,0|i0002b:,,,,,,,,To Do,07/Oct/26 9:57 AM
Reporting and audit trail,DRB-5,10015,Epic,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,07/Oct/26 9:57 AM,07/Oct/26 9:57 AM,,,,0,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},,,0|i0002m:,,,,,,,,To Do,07/Oct/26 9:57 AM
US-01: SMS 2FA Authentication,DRB-22,10032,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:52 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want to log in using my account details and a mobile OTP so that I can securely view my account.

*Business Value:*
Meets data privacy regulations and prevents unauthorized account access.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Entering a valid Account Number and DOB sends a 6-digit SMS OTP to the registered mobile number. Submitting the correct OTP within 5 minutes logs the user in and redirects to the Account Summary. Entering an incorrect or expired OTP 3 consecutive times locks the session for 15 minutes.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-04 (Enterprise SMS Gateway - Owner TBC), DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Assumes mobile numbers in the database can receive SMS. Maps to Camunda Step 1 (2FA Identity Verification). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i0002w:,,,,,10011,DRB-1,Access and verification,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-02: Account Credential Lookup,DRB-23,10033,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:52 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want the system to validate my Account Number and Date of Birth against core records, so that I am recognized before an OTP is generated.

*Business Value:*
Prevents invalid account access attempts and unnecessary SMS costs.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Submitting credentials queries POST /api/v1/auth/lookup via DEP-01. Matching active records return a masked mobile number and proceed to OTP dispatch. Unmatched records display ""Invalid credentials provided"" without revealing account status.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
API lookup must respond in under 800ms. Maps to Camunda Step 1.1 (Core DB Identity Lookup). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i00034:,,,,,10011,DRB-1,Access and verification,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-03: Session Auto-Logout,DRB-24,10034,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:53 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a compliance officer, I want inactive sessions to log out after 15 minutes so that customer data remains secure.

*Business Value:*
Ensures compliance with banking web security standards.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
After 13 minutes of inactivity, display a popup warning with a 120-second countdown. If inactive for 15 minutes total, clear session tokens and redirect to the login screen.

*Dependencies:*
None

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Uses client-side timer backed by server JWT expiration. Maps to Camunda Sub-process (Session Security Gateway). Estimated Eng Hours: 8.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},2,,0|i0003d:,,,,,10011,DRB-1,Access and verification,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-04: OTP Resend Rate Limiting,DRB-25,10035,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:53 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a product manager, I want to limit OTP resends to 3 per hour so that SMS gateway costs are controlled.

*Business Value:*
Prevents API abuse and reduces messaging costs.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Given a customer clicks ""Resend OTP"", When request count is 3 within 60 minutes, Then a new OTP is dispatched with a 60-second cooldown timer on the button. Given a customer requests an OTP for the 4th time in 60 minutes, When clicked, Then the system blocks the request and displays ""Maximum OTP requests reached. Please try again in 1 hour.""

*Dependencies:*
DEP-04 (Enterprise SMS Gateway - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Counter stored in session cache per Account ID. Maps to Camunda Step 1.2 (SMS Rate Limiter Gateway). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0003e:,,,,,10011,DRB-1,Access and verification,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-05: Real-Time Balance Summary,DRB-26,10036,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:53 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want to see my balance, arrears, and due date on my dashboard so that I understand what I owe.

*Business Value:*
Reduces call volume (SO-01) for routine account inquiries.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
On login, query GET /api/v1/accounts/{id}/balance via DEP-01. Display Total Balance, Arrears Amount, Days Delinquent, and Current Status when data loads. If backend API fails, display ""Account summary temporarily unavailable"".

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Reflects real-time ledger data. Maps to Camunda Step 2 (Account Summary View). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i0003m:,,,,,10012,DRB-2,Account visibility,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-06: Itemized Debt Details,DRB-27,10037,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,09/Oct/26 7:25 AM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want an itemized view of missed payments, fees, and interest so that I can verify my arrears.

*Business Value:*
Increases transparency and reduces billing disputes.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Clicking ""View Statement Details"" expands an itemized view of principal arrears, late fees, and interest. Selecting a line item shows transaction date, original due date, and fee description.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Requires core transaction history API access. Maps to Camunda Step 2.1 (Itemized Debt View). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0003u:,,,,,10012,DRB-2,Account visibility,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-07: Representative Account Workspace,DRB-28,10038,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a representative, I want to view customer balances, plan statuses, and portal history so that I have context on calls.

*Business Value:*
Reduces duplicate checks and manual admin work (SO-06).

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Searching an Account ID displays balance, PTP commitments, dispute flags, and last login time. Customer portal actions update status flags in the activity feed in real time.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper), DEP-03 (Real-Time Ledger Status Flag Writing - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Rep interface covered in prototype deliverables. Maps to Camunda Frontline Swimlane (Rep Interaction History Workspace). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i00041:,,,,,10012,DRB-2,Account visibility,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-08: Outreach Activity Feed,DRB-29,10039,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a representative, I want to see a log of automated SMS and emails sent to the customer to avoid duplicate contact.

*Business Value:*
Prevents redundant communications and improves customer experience.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Opening ""Outreach History"" shows a chronological list of sent messages, timestamps, and channels.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-04 (Enterprise SMS Gateway), DEP-01 (Core DB REST API)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Logs pulled from central notification feed. Maps to Camunda Frontline Swimlane (Outreach Log Feed). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0004f:,,,,,10012,DRB-2,Account visibility,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-09: Self-Service Eligibility Filter,DRB-30,10040,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a product manager, I want the system to check account eligibility at login so ineligible users are redirected.

*Business Value:*
Enforces policy rules and protects restricted or vulnerable accounts.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
If self_service_eligible = false or legal_flag = true, hide payment options and display a support message.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Rules managed in backend policy engine. Maps to Camunda Step 2.2 (Self-Service Policy Filter). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0004l:,,,,,10012,DRB-2,Account visibility,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-10: Payment Plan Selection,DRB-31,10041,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want to choose from pre-approved monthly payment plans so that I can clear my balance over time.

*Business Value:*
Automates repayment agreements for eligible accounts (SO-03).

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Selecting ""Set Up Payment Plan"" calculates and shows 3 installment options (e.g., 3, 6, or 9 months). Selecting a plan proceeds to payment setup.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper), DEP-02 (Payment Gateway Integration - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Options calculated using standard business logic based on total arrears. Maps to Camunda Step 3 (Payment Plan Selection Engine). Estimated Eng Hours: 32.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},8,,0|i0004y:,,,,,10013,DRB-3,Promise-to-pay,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-11: Future-Dated Promise to Pay,DRB-32,10042,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:49 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want to set a promise to pay on a future date (up to 30 days) so that I can schedule my payment.

*Business Value:*
Captures digital payment commitments to lower missed follow-up rates (SO-04).

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Selecting ""Promise to Pay Later"" submits a date (within 30 days) and amount via POST /api/v1/commitments/ptp. On success, sets ptp_active = true, updates ptp_due_date in the ledger via DEP-03, and sends an SMS confirmation.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API), DEP-03 (Ledger Flag Writing), DEP-04 (SMS Gateway)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Future date restricted to 30 days per policy. Maps to Camunda Step 3.1 (P2P Commitment Gateway). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i00056:,,,,,10013,DRB-3,Promise-to-pay,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-12: Card Payment Processing,DRB-33,10043,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want to securely enter card details so that I can pay immediately or set up plan installments.

*Business Value:*
Enables direct payment collection via secure card tokenization.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Embeds PCI-compliant Payment Gateway iFrame (DEP-02) for card input. Upon authorization, displays receipt and logs payment in core ledger.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-02 (Payment Gateway Integration - Owner TBC), DEP-01 (Core DB REST API)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Portal does not store card numbers. Maps to Camunda Step 3.2 (PCI Payment Gateway iFrame). Estimated Eng Hours: 32.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},8,,0|i0005i:,,,,,10013,DRB-3,Promise-to-pay,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-13: Plan & P2P Confirmations,DRB-34,10044,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want written confirmation via email and SMS after setting up a plan or P2P date.

*Business Value:*
Provides written proof of agreement and reduces follow-up calls.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Sends confirmation via email and SMS upon setting a payment plan or P2P. Failed dispatches log an error event in the customer feed.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-04 (Enterprise SMS Gateway - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Emails include installment schedule details. Maps to Camunda Step 3.3 (Notification Engine Dispatch). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0005m:,,,,,10013,DRB-3,Promise-to-pay,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-14: Outreach Suppression,DRB-35,10045,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a compliance officer, I want automated outreach paused immediately on disputes or hardship disclosures so that collections stop during reviews.

*Business Value:*
Maintains regulatory compliance during active disputes or hardship reviews.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Dispute or hardship events set outreach_suppression = true in core ledgers within 2 seconds. Accounts with outreach_suppression = true are excluded from automated campaign lists.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-03 (Real-Time Ledger Status Flag Writing - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Suppression immediately halts active dialer lists. Maps to Camunda Step 4 (Outreach Suppression Event). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i0005x:,,,,,10014,DRB-4,Routing and exception handling,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-15: Dispute & Hardship Form,DRB-36,10046,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a customer, I want to submit a dispute or hardship form online so that my situation is recorded and collections are paused.

*Business Value:*
Provides self-service intake for vulnerable customers and ensures compliance.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Submitting a ""Dispute Balance"" or ""Declare Hardship"" form records the reason code and statement. Submission sets dispute_flag or hardship_flag to true, enables outreach_suppression, and displays confirmation.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper), DEP-03 (Ledger Flag Writing)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Captures standard dispute categories (e.g., Fraud, Incorrect Balance). Maps to Camunda Step 4.1 (Dispute & Hardship Intake Gateway). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i00060:,,,,,10014,DRB-4,Routing and exception handling,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-16: Exception Queue Routing,DRB-37,10047,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As an operations leader, I want dispute and hardship cases routed to specialist queues so that complex cases receive expert review.

*Business Value:*
Routes complex cases away from automated systems to trained staff (SO-05).

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Accounts with dispute_flag = 1 or hardship_flag = 1 are routed to Dispute_Specialists or Vulnerability_Team queues. Routing initiates an SLA tracking timer for the task.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper), Camunda 8 Workflow Engine Integration

*Notes / Assumptions:*
SLAs configured per category in workflow engine. Maps to Camunda Step 4.2 (Camunda Exception Routing Gateway). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i0006a:,,,,,10014,DRB-4,Routing and exception handling,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-17: SLA Callback Escalations,DRB-38,10048,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Medium,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a supervisor, I want overdue callback timers to escalate so that exception cases are handled promptly.

*Business Value:*
Prevents exception cases from stagnating in queues.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Tasks nearing SLA limits display an ""Amber"" status indicator. Expired SLAs turn ""Red"" and escalate to the Team Leader queue.

*Dependencies:*
Camunda 8 Timer Boundary Events, DEP-03 (Ledger Flag Writing)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Timer durations set in workflow engine. Maps to Camunda Step 4.3 (BPMN Boundary SLA Timer). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0006c:,,,,,10014,DRB-4,Routing and exception handling,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-18: Legal Review Handoff,DRB-39,10049,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a compliance director, I want unresolvable cases escalated for manager review so legal protocols can be applied.

*Business Value:*
Ensures legal action decisions are governed by manual specialist review.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Unresolved exceptions escalate to a Manager Review task for evaluation. Toggling legal_flag = true suppresses self-service and exports the file to the legal team.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper), DEP-03 (Ledger Flag Writing)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Implements portal handoff trigger for legal assessment. Maps to Camunda Step 4.4 (Manager Review & As-Is Legal Handoff). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0006l:,,,,,10014,DRB-4,Routing and exception handling,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-19: Real-Time Status Write-Back,DRB-40,10050,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a finance analyst, I want portal actions to write status updates directly to core DB tables so ledger flags stay synchronized.

*Business Value:*
Resolves data sync issues and prevents recovery losses (DEP-03).

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Completed actions trigger PUT /api/v1/ledgers/flags to update database columns within 2 seconds. An HTTP 200 OK response commits the database transaction.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-03 (Real-Time Ledger Status Flag Writing - Owner TBC), DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Uses API write-backs without changing core schema structure. Maps to Camunda Step 5 (Core DB Status Flag API Write-back). Estimated Eng Hours: 20.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},5,,0|i0006m:,,,,,10015,DRB-5,Reporting and audit trail,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-20: Immutable Audit Logging,DRB-41,10051,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,High,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,,,,0,"*User Story:*
As an auditor, I want every portal interaction saved as an immutable, timestamped log entry for full traceability.

*Business Value:*
Ensures complete compliance and auditable record-keeping.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Portal actions log timestamp (UTC), Account ID, Actor ID, Action Code, IP, Old Value, and New Value. Logged entries are permanent and cannot be altered or removed.

*Dependencies:*
DEP-01 (Core DB REST API Wrapper - Owner TBC)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Written to append-only compliance repository. Maps to Camunda Step 5.1 (Append-Only Compliance Audit Log). Estimated Eng Hours: 12.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},3,,0|i0006u:,,,,,10015,DRB-5,Reporting and audit trail,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
US-21: Conversion Telemetry,DRB-42,10052,Story,To Do,DRB,Debt Recovery Backlogs,software,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,Low,,,,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM,08/Oct/26 3:11 PM,,,0,"*User Story:*
As a product manager, I want completion rates tracked across funnel steps so that I can evaluate user journeys.

*Business Value:*
Provides telemetry data to measure and optimize user conversion.

*Acceptance Criteria:*
Telemetry logs user transitions through Auth, Summary, Plan Selection, and Confirmation steps. Exiting without completion triggers an ""Abandoned Funnel"" event with the last screen viewed.

*Dependencies:*
None (Frontend Analytics Integration)

*Notes / Assumptions:*
Telemetry data is anonymized and aggregated. Maps to Camunda Step 5.2 (Analytics Telemetry Tracker). Estimated Eng Hours: 8.",,Zakariah Hassan,712020:60848d52-fe92-41d8-9920-7ea28a4b065c,,,,,,,,,{},2,,0|i00079:,,,,,10015,DRB-5,Reporting and audit trail,To Do,08/Oct/26 2:48 PM
